---
component: shutOut
params:
  who: speaker
  place: { type: { entity: place } }
# (0.27) a beat template: the same place, once that route is locked. It outranks
# the hangout and repeats, so the player learns the door is shut.
beat:
  on: visit
  target: "place.@place"
  priority: 10
  once: "false"
  when: "holds(locked(@who))"
---

## Shut

// The beat's own line first; then the place, rendered through the place kind's
// `labels:` (0.27: an entity-typed param renders its label).
::body
@narrator: You leave {{@place}} the way you came.
